# CHG-2083 (approved): in the target, the gateways (PingGateway) take Tech Pubs over from PingAccess; its media
# application stays with PingAccess. Tech Pubs' protected application (projected from PingAccess by CHG-2061) records
# the secret role of the client it signs in as, and the target's own overrides have the gateways enforce it and set
# X-TechPubs-User (the plan's fix enforcer-header:techpubs-user). The target's PingAccess render leaves Tech Pubs out
# and its PingGateway render gives it a route; what PingGateway can't express of it (the session's maximum lifetime)
# stays in the plan.
dn: cn=techpubs,ou=protected-applications,dc=ciam-ops
changetype: modify
add: ciamCredentialRole
ciamCredentialRole: pa-techpubs-client-secret
-
add: ciamOwner
ciamOwner: cn=tech-pubs-team,ou=owners,dc=ciam-ops
-
add: ciamChangeRef
ciamChangeRef: cn=CHG-2083,ou=changes,dc=ciam-ops

dn: cn=techpubs-enforcer,ou=overrides,env=prod,cloud=target,ou=environments,dc=ciam-ops
changetype: add
objectClass: top
objectClass: ciamOverride
cn: techpubs-enforcer
ciamOverrides: cn=techpubs,ou=protected-applications,dc=ciam-ops
ciamOverrideAttribute: ciamEnforcedByRole
ciamOverrideValue: ig
ciamOwner: cn=tech-pubs-team,ou=owners,dc=ciam-ops
description: The target's gateways protect Tech Pubs; its media application stays with PingAccess
ciamChangeRef: cn=CHG-2083,ou=changes,dc=ciam-ops

dn: cn=techpubs-user-setter,ou=overrides,env=prod,cloud=target,ou=environments,dc=ciam-ops
changetype: add
objectClass: top
objectClass: ciamOverride
cn: techpubs-user-setter
ciamOverrides: cn=techpubs-user,ou=header-contracts,dc=ciam-ops
ciamOverrideAttribute: ciamSetByRole
ciamOverrideValue: ig
ciamOwner: cn=tech-pubs-team,ou=owners,dc=ciam-ops
description: The gateways set X-TechPubs-User for Tech Pubs in the target
ciamChangeRef: cn=CHG-2083,ou=changes,dc=ciam-ops
